= The Government Falls

Our coalition partners have had enough. [? if rc_chancellor : They table a motion of no confidence in Chancellor [+ chancellor +], and it passes. ?][? if not rc_chancellor : They withdraw their support, and the government collapses. ?] The Senate must elect a new Supreme Chancellor.

[? if not constructive_vonc : A constructive no-confidence amendment would have prevented this kind of collapse. ?]
